WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.952
Guan Yu guarded Jingzhou and won victory after victory, growing proud and arrogant, looking down on everyone.

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:10.022
He stood on the city tower, gazing into the distance, his face full of pride.

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:16.084
He looked down on Wu's Lu Meng, and personally led his great army north to attack Cao Wei's cities.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:20.514
Only a few soldiers were left in Jingzhou to guard the city gates.

00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:25.616
Lu Meng pretended to be ill, while secretly moving troops and generals, preparing a sneak attack on Jingzhou.

00:00:25.966 --> 00:00:28.654
His plan was very thorough, and no one noticed a thing.

00:00:29.004 --> 00:00:36.444
One night, the Wu soldiers changed into white clothes, pretended to be merchants, and quietly crossed the great river.

00:00:36.794 --> 00:00:41.162
The river surface was silent, and the guards did not notice anything at all.

00:00:41.512 --> 00:00:46.744
Jingzhou's gates opened wide, the Wu army took the city at a stroke, and Guan Yu's rear was completely lost.

00:00:47.094 --> 00:00:51.414
When the news reached the front line, Guan Yu was shocked and furious, hardly able to believe it.

00:00:51.764 --> 00:00:57.236
Attacked from front and back with nowhere to go, Guan Yu was finally captured by the Wu army, ending his legendary life.

00:00:57.586 --> 00:01:01.906
This story reminds us that pride makes people lose their vigilance.

